    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      291.53,
      401.88,
      315.47
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Penal Code(Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      329.33,
      401.89,
      391.07
    ],
    "text": "2.The word \u201cCeylon\u201d, wherever it appears in the PenalCode (Chapter 19) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) other than in sections 3, 18A, 120, 138, 158,159, 160, 225 and 256A thereof, shall be substituted with theword \u201cSri Lanka\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      404.93,
      401.87,
      441.47
    ],
    "text": "3.The word \u201cQueen\u201d, wherever it appears in theprincipal enactment, other than in sections 19, 115 and 120thereof, shall be substituted with the word \u201cRepublic\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      480.53,
      401.9,
      504.47
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 12 of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed and the following section is substituted therefor:-",
