      252.47
    ],
    "text": "29.Section 478A of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the repeal of paragraph (b) of subsection (2)thereof and the substitution therefor of the followingparagraph:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
